// Sound-effect catalog: one entry per file in public/sfx/<name>.wav.
// Single source of truth for the composition (SfxName), the Lab UI (Biblioteca) and the AI prompts
// (lab/lib/schemas.mjs imports this file directly — keep it plain data, erasable TypeScript only).
// New synthesized sounds are generated by scripts/make-sfx.mjs.

